  "goodToKnow": "Heranwachsend means growing up or adolescent: heranwachsende Kinder, die heranwachsende Generation. Legally, der Heranwachsende is a young adult aged 18 to 20; under the Jugendgerichtsgesetz, courts can apply juvenile law to them if they are judged still immature. Jugendliche are 14 to 17, and Kinder under 14 are not criminally liable. Heranwachsen means to grow up."
